  "28.2": {
    "title": "Deterministic utility selection with hysteresis",
    "contract": "Input scores mapping nonempty action names to finite scores or null (invalid), current action or null, and nonnegative margin. Return action and reason. Highest score wins, lexicographic name breaks ties. Retain a valid current action unless alternative score is strictly greater than current+margin.",
